own.SmoothFlow.coe_bilinX_physField","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.powerBilinPhys_of"],"uses":["Breakdown.Freq.CSpace","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.IsSolenoidalSymbol","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.advectionAt_physField","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.advectionSymbol","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.hsNormSq","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.memLp_weight_of_hsNormSq","Breakdown.SmoothFlow.physField","Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.advectionAt"],"written":"advectionAt_physField_eq"}],"imports":["Breakdown.Uniqueness.RegPhysAuxProduct"],"module":"Breakdown.Uniqueness.RegIdentifyAuxAdvect","path":"Breakdown/Uniqueness/RegIdentifyAuxAdvect.lean","sha256":"1f7218d191b18e4bf4e998d6a6b6c525c18e04d38dd00c461afbe0edd5cad5d8","source":"import Breakdown.Uniqueness.RegPhysAuxProduct\n\nopen scoped ContDiff ENNReal FourierTransform Topology\nopen MeasureTheory Set Real Filter\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown.SmoothFlow\n\nopen Breakdown.Freq\n\ntheorem memLp_weight_of_hsNormSq {f : Space → CSpace} (hm : AEStronglyMeasurable f volume)\n    (hf : ∀ m, hsNormSq m f < ⊤) (k : ℕ) : MemLp f 1 (weightL1Measure k) := by\n  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := weightedFreqL1_le k\n  rw [memLp_weight_iff hm]\n  refine lt_of_le_of_lt (hC f) (ENNReal.mul_lt_top ENNReal.ofReal_lt_top ?_)\n  exact ENNReal.rpow_lt_top_of_nonneg (by norm_num) (hf (k + 2)).ne\n\ntheorem advectionAt_physField_eq {f : Space → CSpace} (hm : AEStronglyMeasurable f volume)\n    (hs : IsSolenoidalSymbol f) (hf : ∀ m, hsNormSq m f < ⊤) :\n    (fun x => advectionAt (physField f) x) = physField (advectionSymbol f) :=\n  funext fun x => advectionAt_physField (memLp_weight_of_hsNormSq hm hf) hs x\n\n\nend Breakdown.SmoothFlow\n"}